## Step 5 — Check your work

1. `npm ci`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run build` — the Pages build still works and `dist/` is unchanged in content from before your change (compare file lists and hashes).
2. `npm run build:itch` ends with `OK` and produces `dist/mavooli-itch.zip`; run it twice and confirm the two ZIPs are byte-identical.
3. `npm run verify:itch` passes. Unzip the ZIP into a fresh folder and confirm `index.html` is at the root and every URL in it is relative.
4. Serve `dist/itch/` locally under a nested path and inside a cross-origin iframe; confirm the intro, the loading bar, "Press to start", the Home Screen, Survival and Creative modes, walking with keyboard and drag, zoom with wheel and pinch, and no console errors.
5. Plant a failure on purpose (an absolute `/foo.png` in the itch `index.html`, an extra `.map` file, an external `https://` script) and confirm validation fails with a clear message and no ZIP; then remove it.
6. Lint the workflow YAML (e.g. `actionlint` if available) and reason through both jobs, including the butler job's skip path.

